## Model
`sklearn.ensemble.IsolationForest`, `{hyperparams}`, `random_state={seed}`; exported with skl2onnx
(opset 17 / ai.onnx.ml 3). The ONNX `scores` output reproduces sklearn's `decision_function`
(max abs diff {onnx_max_abs_diff:.2e}).

**Calibration** (stored in `{model_name}.context.json`): anomaly score `s = −score_samples`;
`r_img = clip((s − {s_median:.4f}) / ({s_p99:.4f} − {s_median:.4f}) · 0.5, 0, 1)` — benign training
median → 0.0, benign 99th percentile → 0.5.

